    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "With the default settings an oven stops growing at $(item)6x6$(): 36 blocks, six high and six deep. It cooks a coal in $(item)20 s$(), three times faster than a single block."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Blocks added above or behind a full 6x6 stay separate small ovens. A server can lower the limit with cokeOvenMaxSize.$(br2)One big oven still cooks one item at a time, so feed it with a funnel and empty its fluids often."
